msgstr "MALE NURSE KOSTYA HAS BEEN ON DUTY INSIDE FOR THREE MONTHS. HE TIED THE PATIENTS TO THEIR BEDS AND TREATS THEM WITH ASPIRIN. THE PATIENTS GROWL, BUT KOSTYA DOESN'T GIVE UP."

msgid "ВО ДВОРЕ ДЕНИС НАШЁЛ ПИКАП И ЗА НОЧЬ ПРЕВРАТИЛ ЕГО В БРОНЕПИКАП. «ЭТО НЕ РЕМОНТ, ЭТО ИСКУССТВО», — СКАЗАЛ ОН И УСНУЛ ПРЯМО ПОД МАШИНОЙ."
msgstr "DENIS FOUND A PICKUP IN THE YARD AND OVERNIGHT TURNED IT INTO AN ARMORED PICKUP. \"THIS ISN'T A REPAIR, IT'S ART,\" HE SAID, AND FELL ASLEEP RIGHT UNDER THE CAR."

msgid "ВОДИТЕЛЬ"
