msgstr "THE HOWL COMES FROM THE TOP OF THE PASS. THERE, AT AN OLD HIKERS' LODGE, LIVES THE SHEPHERD: TWICE A MAN'S HEIGHT, PALE AS SNOW, WITH A VOICE THAT RATTLES WINDOWS."

