msgstr "THE DROWNED ONE CRASHED INTO THE WATER AND A WAVE WASHED OVER THE PIER. TYOMA SHOUTED: \"CONGRATS, YOU BEAT A DOCKER!\" PALYCH TOOK OFFENSE ON BEHALF OF DOCKERS."

