msgstr "THE \"GENOME\" PLANT. THIS IS WHERE THEY KEPT \"ROT-7\" — THE MEDICINE THAT CANCELED DEATH. THIS IS WHERE THE NEST WAS BORN."

msgid "Цветы в ящиках вокруг флага. Вера поливает их кофе — растут"
msgstr "Flowers in planters around the flag. Vera waters them with coffee — they grow"

